%% title: DE — Saga execution, character mint & nickname pre-emption (as of 2024-04)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Game server
    box rgb(219,234,254) My contributions ★
    participant BP as business-provider<br/>(gRPC facade · input validation ★)
    participant S as saga-provider<br/>(Saga runner · domain validators ★)
    participant A as Transaction analyzer<br/>(chain-result worker · partial ★)
    end
    participant R as Redis
    participant E as event-service<br/>(state store · Prepare/Commit/Rollback)
    participant BC as Blockchain
    G->>BP: Mint character (gRPC)
    BP->>BP: Validate input · convert
    BP->>S: Saga Execute (synchronous gRPC)
    S->>R: Pre-empt nickname · lock character ★<br/>(distributed lock instead of existence check)
    S->>E: Prepare (create new nickname · remove old one)
    S->>BC: Mint transaction
    BC-->>A: Chain result event (Kafka)
    A->>S: ApplyMint success/failure + nickname ★ (Kafka)
    alt success
        S->>E: State UNLOCK · apply nickname (Prepare → Commit)
        S->>R: Release old nickname pre-emption ★
    else failure
        S->>E: Rollback · record failed state UNLOCK
        S->>R: Release new nickname pre-emption ★
    end
    S->>R: Release character lock ★
